### Appointments API — requests for the IntelliJ HTTP Client (select the "local" environment).
### Start the app first (see README: "Run locally"). Credentials and ids come from
### http-client.env.json; they are the defaults of the `local` profile.
###
### There is no token to generate: callers authenticate with HTTP Basic (D-012).
### `Authorization: Basic <user> <password>` below is encoded to base64 by IntelliJ.
###
### The booking requests pick a random future slot on the 30-minute grid, so you can
### run them repeatedly. (Booking the same patient twice at the same slot is only
### handled gracefully from Step 3 of the plan.)

### Book an appointment (201)
< {%
    const day = 1 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 300);
    const slot = new Date(Date.now() + day * 24 * 3600 * 1000);
    slot.setUTCHours(8 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 10), Math.random() < 0.5 ? 0 : 30, 0, 0);
    request.variables.set("slot", slot.toISOString());
%}
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{bookingUser}} {{bookingPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{demoPatientId}}",
  "specialty": "CARDIOLOGY",
  "startAt": "{{slot}}"
}

### Slot in the past (400 SLOT_IN_PAST)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{bookingUser}} {{bookingPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{demoPatientId}}",
  "specialty": "CARDIOLOGY",
  "startAt": "2020-01-07T14:00:00Z"
}

### Slot not on the 30-minute grid (400 SLOT_NOT_ALIGNED)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{bookingUser}} {{bookingPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{demoPatientId}}",
  "specialty": "CARDIOLOGY",
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T14:15:00Z"
}

### Missing and invalid fields (400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{bookingUser}} {{bookingPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "not-a-uuid",
  "specialty": ""
}

### Unknown patient (404 PATIENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{bookingUser}} {{bookingPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff",
  "specialty": "CARDIOLOGY",
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T14:00:00Z"
}

### Unknown specialty (404 SPECIALTY_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{bookingUser}} {{bookingPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{demoPatientId}}",
  "specialty": "ASTROLOGY",
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T14:00:00Z"
}

### No credentials (401)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{demoPatientId}}",
  "specialty": "CARDIOLOGY",
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T14:00:00Z"
}

### Wrong role: ADMIN cannot book (403)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "{{demoPatientId}}",
  "specialty": "CARDIOLOGY",
  "startAt": "2030-01-07T14:00:00Z"
}

### OpenAPI document (any authenticated caller)
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
Authorization: Basic {{adminUser}} {{adminPassword}}

### Health (public)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
